---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const email = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL || 'bryce@originslynk.com';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy notice"
  description="How OriginsLynk collects, uses, protects, and deletes information submitted through this website."
>
  <section class="section-cream page-hero">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
      <h1>A short explanation of what happens to your information.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        OriginsLynk is operated by Primitive Origins LLC. This notice covers information
        submitted through originslynk.com and direct conversations that begin here.
      </p>
      <p class="small muted updated">Effective August 1, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container container-narrow notice">
      <article>
        <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
        <p>
          The service request form asks for your name, work email, business name, the
          situation closest to your problem, what happens now, what should happen instead,
          a category describing whether sensitive or regulated information may be involved,
          consent to be contacted, and an optional service preference.
          We also receive whatever you choose to include in a direct email or later business
          conversation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Do not submit passwords, API keys, private client records, financial account
          details, health information, or other sensitive credentials through this form.
          Credentials required for an approved project are handled through a separate
          onboarding process.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>How the information is used</h2>
        <p>
          We use inquiry information to respond, understand the workflow you described,
          recommend whether a service is appropriate, prepare a scope, prevent abuse, and
          maintain necessary business records. It is not added to a marketing list, sold,
          rented, or used to train an AI model.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Website and analytics data</h2>
        <p>
          The site records small first-party interaction events such as a consultation-link
          click or FAQ search length. Those events do not contain form answers or search
          terms. The hosting and security provider may process ordinary request and
          performance data, including an IP address, browser information, requested page,
          and timing data, to deliver, measure, and protect the site.
        </p>
        <p>
          OriginsLynk does not use advertising trackers or intentionally set marketing
          cookies on this site. Necessary security or delivery cookies may be set by the
          hosting provider when required to protect or operate the site.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Service providers and disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          The website and contact-delivery system use hosting, security, and email providers
          that process information as needed to deliver the site, prevent abuse, rate-limit
          submissions, and send your request to OriginsLynk. Information may also be
          disclosed when required by law, to protect the service or another person, or as
          part of a business transfer where the recipient assumes the same responsibilities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiry information is kept only as long as reasonably needed to respond, evaluate
          or provide requested services, protect the business, and meet recordkeeping
          obligations. You may ask us to delete an inquiry that is no longer needed, subject
          to any information we must retain for legal, security, or accounting reasons.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may ask what inquiry information we hold about you, request a correction, or
          request deletion by emailing <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Privacy%20request`}>{email}</a>.
          We may need to verify that the request came from the person concerned.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Security and scope</h2>
        <p>
          OriginsLynk uses reasonable technical and organizational safeguards, but no website,
          email system, or transmission method can be guaranteed completely secure. This site
          is intended for business inquiries from adults in the United States and is not
          directed to children.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside>
        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>
          Contact Primitive Origins LLC in Anderson, South Carolina at
          <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Privacy%20question`}>{email}</a>.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-hero h1 { max-width: 17ch; }
  .page-hero .lede { max-width: 62ch; margin-top: var(--space-5); }
  .updated { margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .notice { display: grid; gap: var(--space-7); }
  .notice article { padding-top: var(--space-5); border-top: var(--border-thin) solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .notice h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); }
  .notice p { margin-top: var(--space-3); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .notice aside { padding: var(--space-6); background: var(--ground-sunken); border-left: var(--border-thick) solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius); }
  .notice aside h2 { font-size: var(--text-lg); }
</style>
